WEBVTT

00:10:58.487 --> 00:11:00.489
Again, in the US,

00:11:00.531 --> 00:11:04.243
communities of color
receive eight percent of philanthropy.

00:11:05.452 --> 00:11:07.705
For women and girl's issues,

00:11:07.746 --> 00:11:11.208
it's just 1.9 percent.

00:11:13.419 --> 00:11:19.216
Not even one third of one percent

00:11:19.258 --> 00:11:21.301
goes to the LGBTQ community.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:24.888
We have to change that.

00:11:26.014 --> 00:11:31.562
When we shift the power of philanthropy
into all of our voices,